{"symbol":"CHANDNIMACH","yahoo":"CHANDNIMACH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Chandni Machines Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Industrial Distribution","website":"https://www.cml.net.in","about":"Chandni Machines Limited engages in the trading of engineering goods in India. The company offers plastics and rubber machinery, including die casting, injection molding, and rubber injection molding machines; machine tools comprising boring mills, machining center, EDM wire/sinker, milling machine, drilling machine, lathe, and grinding machine; sheet metal/fabrication equipment, such as shear/guillotine/hack saw, punch press, press brake, and presses; forklifts; and testing equipment. The company also offers metal working machinery, metal handling equipment, and testing equipment. It serves clients in the automobile, pharma, home appliances, textile, metalworking, forging, fabrication, mold makers, steel, bearing, glass, plastic, power generation, aviation, gear making, crankshaft, mining and construction, and other sectors. Chandni Machines Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:14:49+00:00","quote":{"price":93.51,"prevClose":96.0,"marketCap":65.81,"high52":127.74,"low52":31.0,"pe":null,"bookValue":57.57,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":0.7038,"insiders":44.21,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2019-04-08","2019-04-09","2019-04-10","2019-04-11","2019-04-12","2019-04-15","2019-04-16","2019-04-18","2019-04-22","2019-04-23","2019-04-24","2019-04-25","2019-04-26","2019-04-30","2019-05-02","2019-05-03","2019-05-06","2019-05-07","2019-05-08","2019-05-09","2019-05-10","2019-05-13","2019-05-14","2019-05-15","2019-05-16","2019-05-17","2019-05-20","2019-05-21","2019-05-22","2019-05-23","2019-05-24","2019-05-27","2019-05-28","2019-05-29","2019-05-30","2019-05-31","2019-06-03","2019-06-04","2019-06-06","2019-06-07","2019-06-10","2019-06-11","2019-06-12","2019-06-13","2019-06-14","2019-06-17","2019-06-18","201